From 6dbc09e37ce3344467e193847aaa85079810cf34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:29:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/17] L1 threads prototype: --det-threads, seeded baton
 scheduler for Python threads

One managed thread runs at a time; switches only at lock/condition/queue/
event operations, sleep, thread start/join/exit and socket/selector I/O;
waits and sleeps are virtual timers; choices recorded as sched.thread events;
deadlocks raise DeadlockError in every blocked thread; a watchdog escapes a
holder blocked in uncontrolled C code (recorded as threads.uncontrolled).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YAF6Dgp7MTxUYBRZseFL3V
